From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:19:27 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: apple,macaudio: Add the J616s headphone
 jack card

On the J616s (MacBook Pro 16" M4 Pro) the headphone jack's CS42L84 sits
on a different AOP firmware stream than the speaker amps, with a
different frame, and gets a sound card of its own, so that a codec that
never answers costs the jack only. Add its compatible.

Signed-off-by: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit cbfb4d2b7aff06493ca8de7bded6565bd1c64c53)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
index 0c364fdac5..a80f59e315 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/apple,macaudio.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
           - apple,j293-macaudio
           - apple,j314-macaudio
           - apple,j616-macaudio
+          - apple,j616-macaudio-jack
           - apple,j700-macaudio
       - const: apple,macaudio
 
